In this study, we have shown that query expansion techniques can significantly reduce the error associated with dictionary translation. Dictionaries do not provide enough context for accurate translations on a wide range of phrase types, so an alternative must be found. A better phrase translator should not alter our conclusion that query expansion can ameliorate the errors that occur in word-by-word or phrase
